flaky flaky  means something or the other will go  wrong especially the last moment when  everybody is trying to sum it something  or the other goes wrong okay i am  telling this from first and experience  it has happened many many times only in  the past it has happened  okay so at that last moment if you say  that such and such technical problem has  happened no professor is going to  believe you okay they have other  problems i mean 100 other problems to  deal with they are not going to listen  to you  next for online tests what i have seen  is that  because we professors know that  by the very nature of the online test  it is going to be open book and  certainly open internet i mean you can  look up everything you can google  everything it is certainly not a test  for memory we cannot set up our system  like that  so the tests happen to be  more and more difficult so you have to  be really really proficient and good at  your subject to be able to perform well  this is very very important not many  people realize this okay like in an  actual physical test maybe the questions  are not that difficult now one way uh  which in which you can significantly  make your life easier is to have some  kind of a programmatic framework to  automate some of the repetitive tasks  for example in many of the technical  courses you will find  and this is irrespective of the  department you will find that you will  have to calculate eigenvalues or  eigenvectors or maybe you have to  calculate determinants and this is not  just for linear algebra mind you okay in  many of the mechanical engineering  courses we have this and i'm sure even  in electrical engineering and other  other departments you have this  so these kinds of things  you can easily program and keep it ready  at your hand maybe uh in python or  matlab or whatever  you are comfortable with so the moment  these things come you can quickly  calculate these things without the extra  overhead of doing these things manually  or in a much more difficult and  cumbersome way in your calculator okay  so  these are certain important things  which i wish to especially emphasize on  uh i have left out many of the other  things uh so please feel free to  put in some of the important points  which you think are also  extremely important in the  in the comments section and i would just  like to end this video with one extra  thing  is that  if it is indeed true that this is really  the last online semester we are going to  have  my suggestion is that for the last time  enjoy your khana enjoy your mom's  cooking for the last time properly okay  all the best
 

